# Parallax layer over the sky, tiled horizontally at a fraction of the camera
# speed.
#
# 320 wide because 128 was not: at an 800px viewport a short strip puts two
# identical silhouettes on screen at once and the whole illusion goes. Five
# clouds at five sizes and five heights, none of them the same shape, is what
# it costs to make a repeat that reads as sky.
#
# Lit top half, shaded underside — the same top-down light as everything else,
# which is what keeps them in the same world as the ruins below.
name platformer-clouds
size 320 96
key o outline
key L warm-5-hilite
key l warm-3
pixels
